Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.28,0:00:07.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,很久很久以前 在某个地方 有一位村姑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.88,0:00:10.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,村姑上街 去帮家里人跑腿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:13.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,然后... piu！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:15.77,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,从天而降一位英雄少女
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.93,0:00:16.53,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.69,0:00:17.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.09,0:00:19.03,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,真白！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.36,0:00:21.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,乒乓 正确！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.61,0:00:25.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学！能过来一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:26.24,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.07,0:00:28.85,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,等我回来 再接着讲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.05,0:00:32.22,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.97,0:00:41.49,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,这是小空哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.82,0:00:47.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈... 小空本来计划等会儿从花里面 很可爱地诞生的...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.04,0:00:49.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,坏宝宝哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.63,0:00:51.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,呜... 呜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.21,0:00:57.21,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 好了 怪我把笔放在她能勾到的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:00:58.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.82,0:01:01.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这里一定要好好教育 也是为了小空好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.26,0:01:05.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我来给你讲一个案例 看看一味宠娃最后是个什么下场...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.47,0:01:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:09.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（破碎声）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.15,0:01:11.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 完蛋...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.72,0:01:12.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿红！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.56,0:01:14.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别在家里玩英雄游戏！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.51,0:01:15.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:17.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呸！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:24.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,所以说 小空啊 不能再随便碰真白同学的画了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.06,0:01:26.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们拉钩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.10,0:01:29.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.19,0:01:32.73,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:16.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}新的威胁！救回小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.87,0:03:18.38,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,噗！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.10,0:03:21.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是进入小叛逆期了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.35,0:03:22.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小叛逆期？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.21,0:03:24.69,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,想要这样 想要那样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:27.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不满意自己的意愿 就会耍脾气 闹别扭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.32,0:03:31.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是每一个孩子在成长过程中 都会经历的阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.31,0:03:35.49,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,所以小晴没必要这么沮丧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.70,0:03:38.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,道理我懂...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.08,0:03:40.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.91,0:03:46.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空也想要自己出现在画书上吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.51,0:03:49.19,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空... 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.06,0:03:54.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,可是你随便画的话 小白会哭哭的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.87,0:03:57.19,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,所以不可以 懂了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.23,0:04:04.73,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,蝴蝶 讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:11.98,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,噗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:16.07,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这下头大了 先要哄哄她 别再发脾气了...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:17.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（开门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:20.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这张传单说不定能帮到你们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.10,0:04:23.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,天窗写真馆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.00,0:04:26.86,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不来让小朋友留下最精彩的瞬间吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.17,0:04:29.60,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,有100种以上服装可以租借！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.03,0:04:31.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,臭美宝贝也喜开颜笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.27,0:04:35.04,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爱！小空 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.21,0:04:37.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！这里就有臭美宝贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:39.81,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.18,0:04:44.94,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,还没到？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.12,0:04:47.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就到了 乖乖地再等一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:49.28,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.44,0:04:52.61,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,还没到？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.83,0:04:53.90,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好快！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:56.15,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.43,0:04:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\an8}健身与运动中心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.59,0:05:00.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.96,0:05:01.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.12,0:05:08.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弥诺老哥 厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.47,0:05:09.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弥诺老哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.68,0:05:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近每天都来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:15.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能卧推500公斤 都已经超越人类极限了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:17.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啊 他真的是人类吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.17,0:05:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？你这么一说...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:24.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这股气息是...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.62,0:05:27.58,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么？弥诺彤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.19,0:05:32.62,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,吾在锻炼肌肉 为了能够打倒Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.91,0:05:36.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你下的命令 应该是带回天空公主
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.01,0:05:41.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,恕小人斗胆 吾弥诺彤做不到视眼前的强敌而不顾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.41,0:05:45.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不听我的命令吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.21,0:05:48.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,吾是陛下忠诚的牛马
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:54.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,而同时 也是一个愚蠢到无法克制自己 一味追求强大的武人...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.21,0:06:04.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你... 是你...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.40,0:06:10.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,打开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:15.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.62,0:06:21.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,只有你是靠得住的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.42,0:06:25.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧 把公主带到我的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.61,0:06:28.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,谨遵令旨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.16,0:06:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请从这里面 挑选服装
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:36.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,梦... 梦幻般的可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:38.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这件！我选这件！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.34,0:06:41.91,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这次可不是来给你们拍照的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:43.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:44.41,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 你喜欢哪一件？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.99,0:06:48.05,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.29,0:06:50.22,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 等等... 这是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:53.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些是本馆原创的服装
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.86,0:06:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坊间流传的神秘英雄 他们叫做...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.62,0:06:58.64,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.97,0:07:00.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎哟 你知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:02.97,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小朋友们都很喜欢 这我到是知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:04.40,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最喜欢哪一位Precure？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.60,0:07:07.27,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:12.69,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.17,0:07:17.25,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:21.15,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.94,0:07:25.54,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都喜欢！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.95,0:07:27.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.46,0:07:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（快门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:35.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,广阔无限的蓝天！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.07,0:07:36.96,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.15,0:07:40.54,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,辽阔拂远的柔光！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.71,0:07:42.07,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.05,0:07:45.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,高阔凌云的勇气！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.43,0:07:46.76,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:49.93,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,壮阔飞扬的神彩！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.09,0:07:51.53,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Butterfly！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:53.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,准备...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.52,0:07:54.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,冲！
