Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.85,0:08:02.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢惠顾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.43,0:08:07.36,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,明明是为了公主才去的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:10.97,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么连我们都玩上了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:14.20,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小白 小空怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.44,0:08:17.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,在睡觉觉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.33,0:08:19.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是闹得太厉害了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.02,0:08:25.49,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？小晴？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.75,0:08:26.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.37,0:08:29.97,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,最喜欢了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.79,0:08:39.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我也最喜欢你哦 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:48.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,等到与暗塌谷帝国的战斗告一段落
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:50.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,世界迎来和平
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.30,0:08:53.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,再也不需要Precure的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:57.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空要回到蓝天大地
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:57.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1135,960)}Skyland
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.11,0:09:01.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,从我们的公主 变为人民的公主...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.57,0:09:04.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这是为了小空好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:10.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我真的好想在小空的身边 看着你长大成人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.67,0:09:13.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在的心里 难掩这份情绪...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.33,0:09:15.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我还不成熟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.93,0:09:21.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,道别的一天总会到来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.66,0:09:25.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,但是不是今天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:27.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:31.43,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,在那一天到来之前 一起保护...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:34.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的公主 我们的小空吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:36.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.17,0:09:39.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:40.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（刹车声）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.06,0:09:42.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:46.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？小蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:49.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 我看到有人...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.84,0:09:51.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.11,0:09:58.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,谁... 是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.96,0:10:06.36,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.63,0:10:09.71,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是暗塌谷帝国新派来的敌人的话 我们跟他打吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.29,0:10:11.47,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,他可不简单
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.68,0:10:12.29,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.69,0:10:14.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,他可不是普通的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.79,0:10:18.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,他的眼睛... 看不出战斗前该有神态
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.63,0:10:21.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,没有振奋 没有紧张 没有愤怒 没有憎恨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.30,0:10:23.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,空无一切
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:32.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没见过那种冰冷的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.59,0:10:33.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（碰撞声）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.03,0:10:35.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,上面 他怎么办到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.58,0:10:41.76,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.95,0:10:46.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,打开
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.74,0:10:49.29,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.46,0:10:50.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.28,0:10:51.43,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.43,0:11:01.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}停车场
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.35,0:11:19.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.59,0:11:22.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.64,0:11:23.62,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:26.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 小空她...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.68,0:11:31.72,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.89,0:11:33.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪里？听到了回答我们！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.31,0:11:36.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:40.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.57,0:11:42.71,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,救命
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.19,0:11:46.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧 这一定是在做梦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:49.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才还玩得那么开心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.14,0:11:54.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这一定是在做噩梦...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:58.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（脚步声...）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
